# 1st person turn camera eases out: most of the swing straight away, then it settles.
# Shots straight after a right turn (from north to east); timings are rough (screenshots take time)
wait 17
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press down
wait 1
shot ease_0_before
press right
shot ease_1_just_after
wait 0.05
shot ease_2_after_50ms
wait 0.1
shot ease_3_after_150ms
wait 0.5
shot ease_4_settled
